{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14HTTPDropReportO","text":"HTTPDropReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encoding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations12BatchEncoderP7FailureQa","text":"Failure","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder\/Failure","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait, without a bound, until they are read, so none is missed by reading late."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The sequence ends once the destination and every copy of it are gone and every report has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"been read. Read the sequence into a constant before starting the task that reads it, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the task holds the sequence and not the destination:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let reports = collector.dropReports","Task {","    for await report in reports {","        logger.warning(\"Dropped a batch: \\(report)\")","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination\/dropreports"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"HTTPDestination.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination.swift#L144"},"modules":[{"name":"HTTPDestinations"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","title":"dropReports","externalID":"s:16HTTPDestinations15HTTPDestinationV11dropReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA14HTTPDropReportOy7FailureQy_GGvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dropReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"HTTPDropReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations14HTTPDropReportO"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encoding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Failure","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations12BatchEncoderP7FailureQa"},{"text":">>","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each batch dropped without being delivered, in the order they are dropped."}],"identif